WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.917
Project B changes the output grain from patient to
department The outer

00:00:05.943 --> 00:00:11.846
query groups admissions by department It calculates
total admissions

00:00:12.004 --> 00:00:17.575
distinct patients and average stay A correlated
subquery adds

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:23.533
the count of open admissions for the current
department This shows that correlation

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:27.586
can use a grouping value such as department not only
a patient ID
